WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.250
M. Bison blocks Lily’s standing jab.

2
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.200
Lily guards the recorded Bison Drive Reversal.

3
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
